# A transition air with a grab: straight up the vert ramp at 10 m/s, an Indy (L + right on the press,
# held) at the top, let go on the way down, back in fakie.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap grab+right 222
hold grab 223..262
run 420
expect event trickEnd{trick=Indy} within 240..300
expect no event bail
